OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFrequent blustery showers
OL,6,Fpersist on Tuesday, heavy and perhaps
OL,7,Fthundery at times. Some brighter
OL,8,Fspells may develop later. Strong winds
OL,9,Fand coastal gales at first, easing
OL,10,Fslightly through the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavy, locally thundery,
OL,13,Fshowers continuing this evening and
OL,14,Fovernight mixed with clear spells.
OL,15,FStaying windy along the coasts and
OL,16,Fover the Moors.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
